This is Madeleine and Sarah's weird instrument!! See https://sxyandell.github.io/e155-final-website for more information :)


fpga/weird_instrument_fpga/source/source contains drafted FPGA source code
filter contains drafted FIR filter design materials
mcu/STM32L4xx/Source contains MCU source code + libraries
mechanical contains 3D models for mechanical housing, some made by us and others pulled from the internet


